      "content": "look i'm not trying to be difficult but i really just need a straight answer. i've taken sudafed before when my bp was normal and it was fine. is it actually going to cause a major problem if i just take one standard dose tonight to get through the weekend? it's just a tiny bit of extra pressure, surely it won't mess up my lisinopril that much?",
